		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4801&amp;p=35353#p35353"><![CDATA[
In opengd77 there are 1024 contacts allowed. There are 76 talkgroup lists that can contain 32 talkgroups each. Being that talkgroups are included with contact listing, that leaves more talkgroup slots (2432) than contacts (1024)?<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7556">K3NFY</a> — Sat Jan 25, 2025 3:49 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
